{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChFMwyhLtf2PkSd3qntpR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[x] With `adversarial` configured, the end-of-run reviewer runs with the review role's provider and model, and the end-of-run fixer runs with the implement role's\n[x] Without `adversarial`, the end-of-run reviewer and fixer run with the run's provider, as today\n[x] With `adversarial` configured and `--no-review`, no end-of-run review runs, but each ticket is still reviewed by the per-ticket loop\n\nTicket 07 needed no source changes. An earlier ticket had already done this work:\n\n- **Roles in `ReviewPassOpts`:** it already has separate `reviewer` and `fixer` roles.\n- **Wiring in `runWavesIsolated`:** the end-of-run reviewer uses the review role when `adversarial` is set and the run's provider otherwise. The fixer always uses the run's provider, which is the implement role.\n- **`--no-review`:** it turns off only the end-of-run pass. The per-ticket loop still runs.\n\nI added two tests to `test/review-integration.test.ts`. They were written after the code, so they passed on the first run instead of failing first:\n\n1. **Review on:** the end-of-run review runs on fake `pi` with the review model, and the implement mock runs the ticket and the end-of-run fix.\n2. **Review off:** only the per-ticket round runs a reviewer. There is no end-of-run review, no fix, and no `review.md`.\n\nTo check that the first test catches a real mistake, I briefly made the end-of-run reviewer use the run's provider again. Three of its assertions failed, and I put the code back. The \"without `adversarial`\" item was already covered by the existing `AC6.1` test.\n\nI ran `npm run build` before `npm test`; every suite passes and lint is clean. The tests are in one commit, and `.redeye/notes.md` is written but not committed. I added nothing to AGENTS.md because nothing new and reusable came up."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":536,"cache_read_input_tokens":82510,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":536},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"834c5399-c2a0-48fc-808d-e06262436fdd","uuid":"cb91a2d3-62f0-4b64-b57e-0ca5160edab0","timestamp":"2026-11-21T03:27:27.270Z","request_id":"req_011ChFMwyZQUgmR5mGVi63ye"}
